"""
omarchy-lock-studio — a safe, Omarchy-way lock screen customizer.

* Clones the omarchy.lock plugin (already done -> josephs.lock) and edits the
  user copy in ~/.config/omarchy/plugins/<user>.lock/ (never /usr/share/omarchy).
* Generates LockView.qml from a template, preserving the password field + PAM
  auth signals (so you can always unlock).
* Serves a local web UI (opened in Firefox) with a real-time preview that
  uses your active Omarchy theme colors.
* Backs up LockView.qml before every change; supports restore + restore-stock.

Controls:
  omarchy-lock-studio            start server + open browser
  omarchy-lock-studio --no-open  start server without opening a browser
  omarchy-lock-studio --restore-stock   restore the untouched cloned lock
  omarchy-lock-studio --sync-repo       copy this app into its own project
                                        repo (~/Work/omarchy-lock-studio),
                                        commit and push. Also a web UI button.
"""

